  "description": "Conjugate three regular verbs to talk about simple daily activities.",
  "grammar_note": "Many Croatian present-tense verbs change their ending with the subject. For these examples: ja radim / ti radiš / on radi (I/you/he works); ja učim / ti učiš / ona uči (study); ja čitam / ti čitaš / on čita (read). The pronoun is often optional because the verb ending shows who is acting.",
